The files geometry_*.inp are to be used as the geometry.inp file for
geomtesta. Before compiling readgeometry and readbackground, the flag 
UEDGE_RECT_SLAB must be changed from "0" to "1". A reduced set of tallies, 
obtained by changing the flag OPTIMIZE from "0" to "1" in tallysetup, is 
used for these output data.The number of flights in bk_uers.nc needs to be 
set to 80000 to reproduce this output.
